{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922021031_9a4e13f6","chunk_index":12,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_02ec258233d8e7ca","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7693d868c98988a2","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_384005122a9ff626","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_893db0e17b2da155"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922021031_9a4e13f6","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","quote":"章节标题=妊娠检查和避孕问询","quote_sha256":"e9308eeee19ea9548f61107dcbd6c3cf2dd4ffa6d35c13b2bda79cbe7ea9f930","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","span_id":"span_s1_734_title"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_s1_734_title","span_s2_population","span_s2_exclusion","span_s2_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"妊娠检查和避孕问询","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节说明妊娠检查和避孕问询的目的与范围，适用于筛选期、双盲治疗期及安全性随访期。本研究的目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期女性不符合入组条件。本章节覆盖对具有生育潜力的女性受试者进行妊娠状态评估和避孕咨询的相关内容，以支持对研究期间妊娠风险的监测与管理，并与研究药物的生殖毒性特征、目标人群的生育潜力以及相关监管要求保持一致。","rationale":"当前项目来源确认目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期女性被排除，研究时期包括筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期。本章节仅说明妊娠检查和避孕问询的目的与范围，未指定妊娠检测方法、检测时间点、避孕措施清单或妊娠报告路径；这些项目特异规则需医学作者结合研究药物生殖毒性资料和安全性管理要求确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_02ec258233d8e7ca","section_number":"7.3.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922021031_9a4e13f6","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","quote":"章节标题=安全性评价","quote_sha256":"fe04e96c7ce11f398f8f2d8446c1d469da0bbab148a581f9f22ff40b5880337b","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","span_id":"span_s1_8_title"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_s1_8_title","span_s2_intervention","span_s2_safety_endpoints","span_s2_visits","span_s2_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"安全性评价","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节概述本研究的安全性评价内容。研究药物为合成试验药A，采用100 mg口服、每日一次、连续16周的给药方案，对照为匹配安慰剂。安全性评价贯穿筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期，重点关注治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。治疗期访视安排在第2、4、8、12、16周，第20周进行安全性随访。安全性分析将基于安全性集，按实际接受的治疗进行。","rationale":"当前项目来源确认合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次连续16周、匹配安慰剂对照、安全性终点及第2、4、8、12、16周和第20周访视安排，并确认安全性集按实际治疗分析。本章节未展开AE/SAE定义、报告时限、剂量调整或停药规则；上述实施细节需医学作者核对项目安全性管理文件后确定。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7693d868c98988a2","section_number":"8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922021031_9a4e13f6","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","quote":"章节标题=总则","quote_sha256":"98576148065fd1028f88aa9c6a038f966ba553b81b2935b1b45abefccfaefc30","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","span_id":"span_s1_81_title"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究","quote_sha256":"39f86855784611b541acfcdc9bde1954b606955366139902ea030dd2587d715e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_study_title"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_phase"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_s2_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_s1_81_title","span_s2_study_title","span_s2_phase","span_s2_intervention","span_s2_safety_endpoints","span_s2_periods","span_s2_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"总则","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节规定安全性评价的总体原则与范围，适用于本研究的筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期。安全性评价旨在评估合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者的安全性。评价内容涵盖不良事件监测、严重不良事件和导致停药的不良事件的记录与评估，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图等安全性指标的临床意义判断。安全性数据在筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期的访视中进行收集，并按照安全性终点的定义进行评价。安全性评价的实施应与本方案的安全性终点及统计分析策略保持一致。","rationale":"当前项目来源确认研究分期、试验干预、安全性终点和研究时期，支持总则中对安全性评价范围与原则的概述。本章节未写入具体不良事件分级、因果关系判定、报告对象与时限、剂量调整或停药标准；上述内容需医学作者根据项目安全性管理计划确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_384005122a9ff626","section_number":"8.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922021031_9a4e13f6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"定义","missing_source_classes":["安全性术语定义与判定标准（AE、SAE、TEAE的定义、严重程度分级及因果关系判定）","药物警戒或安全性数据管理计划","研究药物安全性参考信息（如研究者手册）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目来源仅提供安全性终点列表，未提供治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件等术语的项目定义、严重程度分级或因果关系判定规则。为避免臆造定义，本章节未生成正文，需补充安全性术语定义来源或相应职能确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_893db0e17b2da155","section_number":"8.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:09d7dfb5fab62e610194ff2c","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"cea1dd8d5ff563ac02bcffc02ebbd03507d94f79f3eac5044fad9404a0e6aa36"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"}]}